From: Andre Fonseca <andre@windscribe.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:08:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Anti-censorship: port v2 patches (udp-stuffing,
 tcp-split-reset, i1-i5, Jc/Jmin/Jmax, junk-first) to OpenVPN 3.11.7

Ported from OpenVPN 2.7 anti-censorship patches, adapted to the
3.11.7 transport/proto layer. All logic kept in anti_censorship.hpp
for out-of-tree maintenance.
---
